WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.175
Food has a language.

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:12.790
Food allowed me to
become an artist.

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:16.540
What I want to do is
to invite you to really

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:21.820
understand and appreciate
vegetables on a deeper level.

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:24.610
I don't like the
convention of things,

00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:27.700
but I do things because
I want change to happen.

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:33.670
La salade de melons.

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:38.470
I'm gonna show you how to make
vegetarian recipes at home

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:40.165
to impress your
family and friends.

00:00:44.132 --> 00:00:45.450
Are you guys ready?

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Mmm.

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.550
Whether you're a meat
eater, a vegetarian,

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:50.210
this class is for you.

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:52.300
I'm gonna show you
how to peel asparagus.

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:57.310
Hold the asparagus here at the
tip so you don't crush the tip.

00:00:57.310 --> 00:00:59.590
I will say you
undress the asparagus.

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:02.230
[CHUCKLES] So good.

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:03.650
Mmm.

00:01:03.650 --> 00:01:04.150
Wow.

00:01:06.275 --> 00:01:10.090
All right, so we are
grilling the melon.

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:11.080
Oh yeah.

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:12.878
It's OK if you get messy.

00:01:12.878 --> 00:01:14.420
Your hands kind of
smell like garlic,

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:16.390
so I just put a little
bit of lemon on my hand.

00:01:16.390 --> 00:01:18.110
This is not about perfection.

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:19.450
Just wash it like this.

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:21.100
It's about deliciousness.

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:26.470
My restaurant, Atelier Crenn,
means workshop in English.

00:01:26.470 --> 00:01:27.850
Oh yeah, this is good.

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:31.400
A place where you
bring your creativity.

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:32.192
Beautiful.

00:01:36.010 --> 00:01:38.170
If you want to
become a cook, you

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:41.620
have to understand
where things come from.

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:43.480
Get to know your farmers.

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:45.040
Cook local.

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:48.520
When you have the best
ingredients-- voila,

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:50.710
La Tomate, tu jardin.

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:53.170
then you can do
the best cooking.

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:55.600
Doesn't matter your
experiences in the kitchen,

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:58.990
I'm inviting you to think
differently about food.

00:02:02.785 --> 00:02:04.910
Je m'appelle Dominique
Crenn, et c'est MasterClass.

